   "id": "is.workflow.actions.comment",
   "p": {
    "WFCommentActionText": "Log-PageShot: a URL in, a screenshot of it committed to shortcuts/shots/ in web-tools-private.\n\nCan run as URL:\nshortcuts://run-shortcut?name=Log-PageShot&input=text&text=<the page URL>\n\nTwo legs, one tap, one image. Leg 1 raises the page in the Show Web View sheet over Shortcuts; leg 2 opens the same page in Safari. Whether the run continues behind the sheet or resumes only when the sheet is dismissed is unmeasured (docs/shortcuts-format-notes.md asserts the first), so the second leg is the insurance: the two shots arrive side by side and the image says which route rendered the page."
   }
